    "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow us</h1><p>Discord: https://discord.gg/kxWrHZ5WDM</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>1. The game focuses on hardcore, mind-bending puzzles. The first three chapters are relatively straightforward, serving as an entry point for players.\r\n2. It's a turn-based board game where the only thing you can control is the panda's movement direction in each turn, defeating or avoiding guards and mechanisms.\r\n3. Completing Side A will unlock Side B, which offers a higher level of difficulty (starting from 6B, it becomes extremely challenging).\r\n4. There is no plot related content; it's a pure deduction or reasoning game where you can obtain complete information from the initial map.",
    "about_the_game": "1. The game focuses on hardcore, mind-bending puzzles. The first three chapters are relatively straightforward, serving as an entry point for players.<br />\r\n2. It's a turn-based board game where the only thing you can control is the panda's movement direction in each turn, defeating or avoiding guards and mechanisms.<br />\r\n3. Completing Side A will unlock Side B, which offers a higher level of difficulty (starting from 6B, it becomes extremely challenging).<br />\r\n4. There is no plot related content; it's a pure deduction or reasoning game where you can obtain complete information from the initial map.",
    "short_description": "This is a turn-based board puzzle game in which a variety of unexpected levels are combined through a simple guard mechanism! You need to skillfully operate your character to pass through guards and various obstacles to finally reach the end!",
